  "description": "Ha Jun-Seo was once a rising star in the classical music world. Now, he manages the career of a more successful friend while drowning his own regrets in clubs and alcohol. After a drunken one-night stand with a stranger, Junseo blacks out, only to wake up in the home of a large, scarred man named Kang Wu-Jin.\n\n*“You don’t remember me?”*\n\nSomething about Wu-Jin feels off, and Jun-Seo tries to run, but the man only smiles ominously.\n\n*“See you soon, Ha Jun-Seo.”*\n\nDays later, Wu-Jin reappears as Jun-Seo’s new boss. Trapped under his obsessive watch, Jun-Seo must figure out who Wu-Jin really is and whether escape is even possible.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
